cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Pooled: peer-to-peer LLM inference in the browser"
message: "If you use Pooled (formerly SwarmLLM) in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Narendrula
    given-names: Nehanth
abstract: "Pooled (formerly SwarmLLM) runs one open language model across the devices in a room, in their browser tabs. Each device holds some of the model's layers and runs them with its own WebGPU kernels; hidden states pass between devices over WebRTC."
repository-code: "https://github.com/Nehanth/pooled"
url: "https://pooled.run"
license: MIT
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-09-07
